    {"id":"visual-stage-n1-001","studyId":"schematic-n1-001","type":"stage-choice","taskCode":"D3A","prompt":"Which stage is this original schematic epoch designed to represent?","options":["W","N1","N2","N3","R"],"answer":"N1","rationale":"This teaching epoch uses a low-amplitude mixed-frequency/theta-oriented EEG background, slow eye movements, and a vertex teaching feature without N2-defining schematic features."},
